  "title": "Richy R NDE 8115",
  "date": "1984",
  "content": "I was leaving a learning center for adults, when I was hit by this bus. This happened some 40 kilometers from my home. Instantly, at unbelievable speed I was at my father's place. I was floating while roaming through the rooms of the house. Then I was back in my body within a few seconds. All this happened in such a state of abundance that it couldn’t be described with our words. I was in the hospital for a few months. Then I got back to my normal life, but with a certain sense of observation of human beings, that I didn't have before. I told this story to four people, as I didn't understand what had been happening to me. Since this experience, I'm not scared of death anymore.",
